  "posted_text": "🗺️ Elections & Voting Rights\nIL HJRCA27 — Illinois Changes How Districts Are Drawn\n\nThe Illinois legislature is creating a commission to redraw state House and Senate districts after each census, ensuring districts are equal in population, protect voting rights, and consider racial demographics – with a court-appointed panel stepping in if the commission fails to deliver a plan by October 5th.\n\nJuly 1, 2026: Rule 19(b) / Re-referred to Rules Committee.",
